# Contract source must stay LF on every checkout.
#
# GenLayer Studio's schema extraction is byte-sensitive: CRLF line endings (and
# any non-ASCII byte) make gen_getContractSchemaForCode fail with
# VM_ERROR: invalid_contract. This user's global core.autocrlf=true would
# otherwise rewrite these files to CRLF on checkout and silently break them.
# tests/test_source_shape.py enforces the same rule in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
